## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.8 27B
- **Short description:** Alibaba’s Qwen 3.8 27B is described in local metadata as a dense open-weights model (Apache 2.0) for agentic coding and vision with extended context support.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights (Hugging Face/hosted providers per local metadata). Local metadata lists `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B`.
- **Context window:** 262,144 native (extensible to 1M with YaRN) per local metadata.
- **Modalities:** Text/image/video input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Open weights (Apache-2.0) self-hosting free; API provider pricing varies (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** Dense 27B model per local metadata; not independently verified in this pass.

